{"c":{"36309":["Narrator",null,"b36309-6KM0riV4lqfN.jpg","This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven't been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work.",2200],"50057":["Tomoko Kuroki","Female","n50057-BiD7X42rU5H1.jpg","Socially inept and often desperate, the series chronicles her various attempts to try to be more popular at her school, Makuhari Shuuei High School. She is 15 years old at the time of the series' debut and was born towards the end of February of either 1994, 1997, or 1998.",3238],"52827":["Yuu Naruse","Female","52827.jpg","Yuu is Kuroki Tomoko's old friend from middle school. Back then she had rather average looks and average grades. After she entered high school she saw that everyone was being flashy and she felt out of place.",87],"67405":["Tomoki Kuroki","Male","n67405-59E4Zri2GTdq.jpg","Tomoko's younger brother.",190],"77181":["Kiko Satozaki","Female","n77181-JtdmqL1UY7IE.png","Kiko is a cousin of Tomoko and Tomoki Kuroki. She first appears in the manga Chapter 14 and in the anime Episode 8 to visit the Kuroki family.",18],"126831":["Hina Nemoto","Female","b126831-iNwyHRlbxStY.png","Hina Nemoto is a classmate of Tomoko since her first year in high school. Hina first met Tomoko during their entrance exam; however, Tomoko quickly forgot about her. She is Tomoko's high school classmate who wants to become a voice actress.",60],"131588":["Chichioya","Male","n131588-coYDnv4QIUwE.png","The father of Tomoko and Tomoki Kuroki.",3],"131589":["Yoshinori Kiyota","Male","n131589-kixnCsKrehmb.png","Tomoko's Classmate.",0],"131590":["Megumi Imae","Female","n131590-nTDGeXZdYPxL.png","The Student Council President of the School Tomoko attends.",19],"131591":["Ogino","Female","b131591-0D2FpLzE6hMh.png","Tomoko's Gym Teacher. Later becomes her Homeroom teacher for 2nd and 3rd year of school.",2],"131592":["Hatsushiba","Male","b131592-kZf1WW6Lezd4.png","Tomoko meets this fine gentleman during her make up class for art. Hatsushiba manages to draw one of the finer art and captures the heart of Tomoko.",1],"131593":["Akane Okada","Female","n131593-e9pXkDTq9Ay2.png","Very outspoken individual. Is also classmates with Tomoko.",2],"131594":["Tannin Kyoushi","Male","n131594-GA4e2QF1vSAF.png","The homeroom teacher of Tomoko in her first year of School.",3],"131595":["Tomoko's Mom","Female","n131595-eTDRw6lwgEkQ.png","The mother of Tomoko and Tomoki Kuroki.",9],"243582":["Suzuki","Male","b243582-gmcBczOxHLIA.png","",0],"243583":["Chuugakusei","Male","default.jpg","",0],"243584":["Konbini Tenin","Male","b243584-VDyDHGeIk9BM.png","",0],"243585":["Fast Food Tenin","Female","b243585-am2c8lckB7sm.png","",1],"243586":["Anime E no Otoko","Male","b243586-gH5SJUFFrLEw.png","",0],"243587":["Fukuura Sensei","Male","b243587-oJIkCbYo83Zs.png","",0],"243588":["Suugaku Kyoushi","Male","b243588-kfCUzHrHTN36.png","",0],"243589":["Eigo Kyoushi","Male","b243589-cTWN6Ron8Efg.png","",0],"243590":["Manken Buin","Male","default.jpg","",0],"243591":["Female Student Couple","Female","b243591-SAfwaXAEumKk.png","",0],"243592":["Male Student Couple","Male","b243592-gRFzVZQVzFES.png","",0],"243594":["Yakyuu-bu Manager","Female","b243594-cbETL5eMwJwL.png","",0],"243595":["Yandere Danshi","Male","b243595-a7ysT2FR8yl1.png","",0],"243605":["Kokugo Kyoushi",null,"default.jpg","",0],"243606":["Kosaka",null,"b243606-I8tGBWMoYoox.png","",2],"243607":["Amagappa no Otoko","Male","b243607-LUouYU6Ib6at.png","",0],"243610":["Joshi Chuugakusei",null,"default.jpg","",0],"243611":["Kosaka's Friend",null,"b243611-SqJytR7sQAJB.png","",0],"243612":["Danshi Seito",null,"default.jpg","",0],"243613":["Joshi Seito",null,"default.jpg","",0],"243614":["Joshi Seito",null,"default.jpg","",0],"243615":["Joshi Seito",null,"default.jpg","",0],"243632":["Naginata Shoujo","Female","b243632-JDMpaCAbhfl4.png","",0],"243633":["Kyoushi",null,"default.jpg","",0],"243634":["Shashou","Male","default.jpg","",0],"243635":["Fukubiki Oji-san","Mal